    <briefdescription>
<para>Plain value snapshot of a single scraper-run&apos;s outcome counters. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Populated by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_scraper_run_summary_collector" kindref="compound">ScraperRunSummaryCollector</ref> after the run completes. All fields are public for direct aggregate construction; callers should treat an instance as a read-only snapshot once it is returned from <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_scraper_run_summary_collector_1afb1308c3b9ab678df014d891c9d8b5b8" kindref="member">ScraperRunSummaryCollector::summary()</ref></computeroutput>. Suitable for structured logging, metrics export, and operator triage. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
